# JustAC local pin: upstream ships no SimulationCraft list for this spec. Damage priority
# for a Preservation Evoker weaving damage between heals, grounded at client build
# 12.1.0.69875. Neither hero tree adds a castable damage button for this spec (Chrono
# Flame upgrades Living Flame in place; Flameshaper's Preservation side is healing), so
# there are no hero-tree branches. Healing spells never reach the damage queue.

# Fire Breath on cooldown whenever its burn is not already rolling. Rank 1 keeps the
# longest burn and the shortest hold; Leaping Flames still sends the next Living Flame to
# a second target. On packs, rank 3 front-loads the damage and lets Leaping Flames hit
# three extra targets.
actions=fire_breath,empower_to=1,if=active_enemies<=2&dot.fire_breath.refreshable
actions+=/fire_breath,empower_to=3,if=active_enemies>=3&dot.fire_breath.refreshable
# Deep Breath is a two-minute damage cooldown (it also heals through Life-Giver's
# Flame), but it moves you: only worth it on a pack.
actions+=/deep_breath,if=active_enemies>=3
# Essence is the healing resource. Disintegrate only spends a free cast (Essence Burst)
# or Essence that would otherwise be wasted at cap.
actions+=/disintegrate,if=buff.essence_burst.stack>=1|essence.deficit<=1
actions+=/azure_strike,if=active_enemies>=3
# Living Flame is the filler: it can grant Essence Burst, and Chrono Flame makes it echo
# recent damage.
actions+=/living_flame
# Instant filler for when you have to move.
actions+=/azure_strike
